      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Mystic Morel (Purple T).</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 4, power rating 13 → a level 4 Bard player-character sheet (a player may take this seat; the authored CR 3 stands in where the ledger is silent). Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Fortune Teller Who Steals Your Future And Your Wallet</strong> — Unknown — possibly independent, possibly serving interests Waluigi cannot identify</p><p>Status: Active — confirmed at the Shadow Estate portal circle with Tanukiburt and the injured real Toadburt</p><p>Mystic Morel—also known as Purple T, also known as the singing Toad who robbed Archie Miser while he was pinned to a bed—is a purple Toad fortune teller who speaks in rhyming prophecies, performs full musical numbers during critical moments, pickpockets people while they're injured, opens planar portals using stolen equipment, and distributes magical tarot cards that depict events the recipient has not yet experienced. He gave Remi 'The Oracle's Deck'—cards showing the Maze Walker, the Titan of the Grove, and the Delicate Host—representing past, present, and future with disturbing accuracy. He stole Archie's watch, keys, and compass during a bedside musical performance, then used those items to tear open a dimensional portal and step through it. He recruited Bryan the Toad and Dan for a hunting expedition targeting Archie. He gave Remi a ring that tightens daily until Archie is found. He removed Dan's Mages' Guild tracking badges. He carries divination incense that enhances prophecy. He is simultaneously the most annoying, the most mysterious, and possibly the most dangerous Toad Waluigi has ever encountered. WAH. Mystic Morel's file now includes direct confirmation that he was at the master-bedroom portal circle with Tanukiburt and the injured real Toadburt while the party held all four portal artifacts. This is exactly the sort of theatrical timing Waluigi expects from Purple T and exactly the sort of timing Waluigi hates. Waluigi correction: records that previously named Mystic Morel refer to the same purple Toad operating under the Morel/Morel naming confusion. The auction-bidder, bedside thief, portal opener, and tarot dealer are one problem wearing multiple labels.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Thrown Card</strong> — “He gave Remi 'The Oracle's Deck'—cards showing the Maze Walker, the Titan of the Grove, and the Delicate Host—representing past, present, and future with disturbing accuracy.”</li><li><strong>Rhyming Prophecy</strong> — “Mystic Morel—also known as Purple T, also known as the singing Toad who robbed Archie Miser while he was pinned to a bed—is a purple Toad fortune teller who speaks in rhyming prophecies, performs full musical numbers”</li><li><strong>Steals Your Wallet Too</strong> — “Mystic Morel—also known as Purple T, also known as the singing Toad who robbed Archie Miser while he was pinned to a bed—is a purple Toad fortune teller who speaks in rhyming prophecies, performs full musical numbers”</li><li><strong>Artifact Dealer</strong> — “He distributes magical artifacts.”</li><li><strong>Sorcerous Song</strong> — “Mystic Morel—also known as Purple T, also known as the singing Toad who robbed Archie Miser while he was pinned to a bed—is a purple Toad fortune teller who speaks in rhyming prophecies, performs full musical numbers”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/mystic_morel</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/mystic_morel</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
